61689b9e6fc_6609925720655874643.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"飞行挑战·全新演绎\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/508100/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/508100/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e飞行挑战·全新演绎\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8911","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"攻略推荐","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"strategy","layout":"","data":"{\"moduleName\":\"攻略推荐\",\"layout_\":\"banner\",\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"默认标题\",\"cover\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"tab_id\":\"1762500776814_0\"}],\"more_link\":\"\",\"baseInfoSwitchDisabled\":false}","style":""}],"id":"8912","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"活动公告","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"multi_table","layout":"","data":"{\"tables\":[{\"tab_name\":\"默认标题\",\"header\":[\"\"],\"row\":[[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\\\"\u003e〓活动奖励〓\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/02/27/50494840/86a50d7efe6d6d6f5582bc13269c356e_2325697759105991980.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"1720\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 1720px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/02/27/50494840/86a50d7efe6d6d6f5582bc13269c356e_2325697759105991980.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 1720px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\\\"\u003e〓活动时间〓\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/02/27/50494840/da8aca28d9c667f5467e07b25c478298_6504883329926518221.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"1600\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 1600px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/02/27/50494840/da8aca28d9c667f5467e07b25c478298_6504883329926518221.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 1600px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\\\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e〓参与条件〓\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(173, 114, 14)\\\"\u003e冒险等阶≥20级\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(173, 114, 14)\\\"\u003e完成魔神任务：序章·第三幕「巨龙与自由之歌」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\\\"\u003e※\u003c/span\u003e完成魔神任务「真实之月」与传说任务「天狼之章 第一幕」后体验更佳。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\\\"\u003e〓活动说明〓\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e● 活动期间，会开启\u003c/span\u003e「错忆寻迹」「闲叙邀佳酌」「狮牙辉影疾斗」和「西风迅鹰侦战录」四个玩法。完成玩法内容可以获得「风境风采」，用以解锁对应的奖励。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e● \u003c/span\u003e在「错忆寻迹」玩法中，存在一些和现实世界不一样的东西，旅行者需要用「寻迹留影机」记录这些差异点，以便修复；\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e● \u003c/span\u003e在「闲叙邀佳酌」玩法中，旅行者将扮演骑士团饮品小站的调饮师，根据宾客们的需求调制饮品，并在闲聊中发掘改进灵感，制作独一无二的特调。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e● \u003c/span\u003e在「狮牙辉影疾斗」玩法中，旅行者将参与一场战斗话剧，不断击败敌人，积累「加护值」，从而召唤「狮牙骑士之影」的支援，使用「剑压」主宰战场。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e● \u003c/span\u003e在「西风迅鹰侦战录」玩法中，旅行者需要与派蒙一同指挥骑士团的飞鹰，沿着一定航线飞行侦察，并击败模拟敌人的标靶。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e● 完成各个挑战，可以获取「风境风采」。累计提升「风境风采」达到指定值，可获取\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(173, 114, 14)\\\"\u003e武器外观「幻礼·星兆」、原石、智识之冕\u003c/span\u003e等奖励。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e※ 活动结束后，获取的武器外观「幻礼·星兆」仍可以正常使用。\u003c/p\u003e\"]]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8979","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"活动简述","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"multi_table","layout":"","data":"{\"tables\":[{\"tab_name\":\"「捕风的归客」活动介绍——参与获取武器外观\",\"header\":[\"\"],\"row\":[[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/02/27/50494840/a7832d0f5a4c5d0130223c6d2da3c94b_2210010281847549408.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"690\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 690px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/02/27/50494840/a7832d0f5a4c5d0130223c6d2da3c94b_2210010281847549408.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 690px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(24, 26, 35)\\\"\u003e自由的风里，一场为迎接回归而准备的\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e特别活动\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(24, 26, 35)\\\"\u003e，正悄悄拉开序幕...\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\